WEBVTT

00:00.640 --> 00:02.320
What do you need me to do?

00:02.400 --> 00:04.680
The relief supplies sent to Qing Province

00:04.760 --> 00:06.160
Actually only half arrived

00:06.400 --> 00:07.280
The rest

00:07.360 --> 00:09.360
Were all embezzled by Chen Ying

00:23.720 --> 00:25.120
And hidden here

00:30.880 --> 00:32.280
Embezzling some money

00:33.240 --> 00:35.280
Is a minor offense for the Chen family

00:35.360 --> 00:37.693
But an imperial marriage won't work then

00:37.920 --> 00:39.160
Miss Chen

00:39.240 --> 00:40.640
My benefit

00:40.880 --> 00:42.240
Seems a bit lacking

00:42.480 --> 00:44.080
A mutually beneficial matter

00:44.160 --> 00:45.920
What else does Your Highness want?

00:46.000 --> 00:47.400
My friendship

00:48.280 --> 00:50.613
Does Your Highness dare to take it?

00:57.760 --> 00:59.160
Why wouldn't I dare?
